      "mergedPostDetails": "- This started happening on Feb 26th\n\n- I tried deleting the cache, but it had no effect\n\n- It occurs when a photo is taken with a print, regardless of world or avatar\n\n- Print on the world and on the VRC+ menu are displayed correctly\n\n- Normal size photo (second image) saved when taken with Print is normal\n\n- This text is using DeepL translation",
