      "mergedPostDetails": "When I take a print, the actual image is saved but the framed version is downloaded as a solid grey image. Apparently I have not downloaded a print successfully since February 9th but I do not do this a lot (only 5) so I don't know how consistent it truly is. In the screenshot you see the regular photo is beside the supposed framed version.",
